      "id": "mathematics-04-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Find the value of 5005 - 5000 ÷ 10.",
      "options": {
        "A": "4505",
        "B": "5000",
        "C": "0.5",
        "D": "500"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "According to BODMAS, divide first: 5000/10 = 500. Then subtract: 5005 - 500 = 4505",
      "hash": "0e0b4f13157a6758",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "5005 - 5000 ÷ 10 का मान ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "4505",
            "B": "5000",
            "C": "0.5",
            "D": "500"
          },
          "explanation": "BODMAS नियम के अनुसार, पहले भाग करें: 5000/10 = 500. फिर घटाएं: 5005 - 500 = 4505"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "What is the sum of the first 20 natural numbers?",
      "options": {
        "A": "200",
        "B": "210",
        "C": "400",
        "D": "420"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Formula: n(n+1)/2 = 20(21)/2 = 10 × 21 = 210",
      "hash": "7318c840bcf62e7d",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "प्रथम 20 प्राकृत संख्याओं (natural numbers) का योग क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "200",
            "B": "210",
            "C": "400",
            "D": "420"
          },
          "explanation": "सूत्र: n(n+1)/2 = 20(21)/2 = 10 × 21 = 210"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If A's salary is 25% more than B's, then by what percentage is B's salary less than A's?",
      "options": {
        "A": "20%",
        "B": "25%",
        "C": "30%",
        "D": "33.33%"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Formula: [r / (100+r)] × 100 = [25 / 125] × 100 = (1/5) × 100 = 20%",
      "hash": "0f4e749ec2a98657",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि A का वेतन B से 25% अधिक है, तो B का वेतन A से कितना प्रतिशत कम है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "20%",
            "B": "25%",
            "C": "30%",
            "D": "33.33%"
          },
          "explanation": "सूत्र: [r / (100+r)] × 100 = [25 / 125] × 100 = (1/5) × 100 = 20%"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-004",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "The length, breadth, and height of a cuboid are 10 cm, 8 cm, and 6 cm respectively. What is its volume?",
      "options": {
        "A": "480 cm³",
        "B": "240 cm³",
        "C": "600 cm³",
        "D": "360 cm³"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Volume = L × B × H = 10 × 8 × 6 = 480 cm³",
      "hash": "a2345725aa9e1d36",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक घनाभ (cuboid) की लंबाई, चौड़ाई और ऊंचाई क्रमशः 10 सेमी, 8 सेमी और 6 सेमी है। इसका आयतन क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "480 सेमी³",
            "B": "240 सेमी³",
            "C": "600 सेमी³",
            "D": "360 सेमी³"
          },
          "explanation": "आयतन = L × B × H = 10 × 8 × 6 = 480 घन सेमी"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-005",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "If a sum of money doubles in 5 years at simple interest, in how much time will it become 4 times?",
      "options": {
        "A": "10 years",
        "B": "15 years",
        "C": "20 years",
        "D": "12 years"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "(n1 - 1)/T1 = (n2 - 1)/T2 => (2-1)/5 = (4-1)/T2 => 1/5 = 3/T2 => T2 = 15 years",
      "hash": "212fc07cdbb94084",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि कोई धनराशि 5 वर्षों में साधारण ब्याज पर दोगुनी हो जाती है, तो उसे चौगुनी (4 गुना) होने में कितना समय लगेगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "10 वर्ष",
            "B": "15 वर्ष",
            "C": "20 वर्ष",
            "D": "12 वर्ष"
          },
          "explanation": "(n1 - 1)/T1 = (n2 - 1)/T2 => (2-1)/5 = (4-1)/T2 => 1/5 = 3/T2 => T2 = 15 वर्ष"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "A, B and C can do a work individually in 12, 15 and 20 days respectively. If they work together, in how many days will the work be completed?",
      "options": {
        "A": "4 days",
        "B": "5 days",
        "C": "6 days",
        "D": "10 days"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "1/12 + 1/15 + 1/20 = (5+4+3)/60 = 12/60 = 1/5. So, 5 days.",
      "hash": "b57680b6591101d2",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "12, 15 और 20 दिनों में A, B और C अलग-अलग एक काम कर सकते हैं। यदि वे तीनों मिलकर काम करें, तो काम कितने दिनों में पूरा होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "4 दिन",
            "B": "5 दिन",
            "C": "6 दिन",
            "D": "10 दिन"
          },
          "explanation": "1/12 + 1/15 + 1/20 = (5+4+3)/60 = 12/60 = 1/5. अतः 5 दिन।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "A car is traveling at a speed of 54 km/hr. What distance will it cover in 1 minute?",
      "options": {
        "A": "600 m",
        "B": "900 m",
        "C": "1000 m",
        "D": "1200 m"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "54 km/hr = 54 × (5/18) = 15 m/s. 1 min = 60 sec. Distance = 15 × 60 = 900 m.",
      "hash": "dd9449ff5a0a97c7",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक कार 54 किमी/घंटा की गति से चल रही है। 1 मिनट में वह कितनी दूरी तय करेगी?",
          "options": {
            "A": "600 मीटर",
            "B": "900 मीटर",
            "C": "1000 मीटर",
            "D": "1200 मीटर"
          },
          "explanation": "54 किमी/घंटा = 54 × (5/18) = 15 मी/से। 1 मिनट = 60 सेकंड। दूरी = 15 × 60 = 900 मीटर।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-008",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "The average of 5 numbers is 27. If one number is excluded, the average becomes 25. What is the excluded number?",
      "options": {
        "A": "25",
        "B": "27",
        "C": "30",
        "D": "35"
      },
      "answer": "D",
      "explanation": "Total sum = 27×5 = 135. New sum = 25×4 = 100. Excluded number = 135 - 100 = 35",
      "hash": "728434b72786c850",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "5 संख्याओं का औसत 27 है। यदि उनमें से एक संख्या हटा दी जाए, तो औसत 25 हो जाता है। हटाई गई संख्या क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "25",
            "B": "27",
            "C": "30",
            "D": "35"
          },
          "explanation": "कुल योग = 27×5 = 135. नया योग = 25×4 = 100. हटाई गई संख्या = 135 - 100 = 35"
        }
      }
    },
